  "0088": "Seated calf raise with the bar resting on your thighs. Isolates the soleus and panturrilhas.",
  "0089": "A seated close-grip curl with the arms braced on the thighs. Isolates the bíceps braquial.",
  "0090": "A seated good morning with the bar on your back. Trains the lombar and glúteos.",
  "0091": "A seated overhead press with the barbell. Builds the deltoides e ombros and tríceps braquial.",
  "0092": "A seated overhead extension holding the bar. Isolates the tríceps braquial.",
  "0093": "A seated trunk rotation com barra on your deltoides e ombros while balancing on a stability ball. Estimula oblíquos and balance.",
  "0094": "A seated torso twist with the bar on your back. Works the oblíquos and músculos abdominais.",
  "0095": "Shrug the deltoides e ombros toward your ears while holding the bar. Builds the upper trapézio.",
  "0096": "A side bend with the bar on your deltoides e ombros. Works the oblíquos.",
  "0097": "A side split squat with the bar on your back, sinking toward one leg. Works the quadríceps and adductors.",
  "0098": "A side-to-side lunge with the bar across the back. Strengthens the quadríceps and adductors.",
  "0099": "A split squat with the rear foot raised and a bar on your back. Strong work for the quadríceps and glúteos.",
  "0100": "A shoulder exercise in which you swing the barbell through a skiing-like pattern. Trains the delts and estabilizadores do core.",
  "0101": "A fast, light back squat. Builds explosive leg power and speed out of the hole.",
  "0102": "Agachamento performed from a kneeling position with the bar on the back. Trains the quadríceps and glúteos.",
  "0103": "A standing roll-out with the barbell. Requires strong músculos abdominais and a firm back.",
  "0104": "A wrist curl with the bar held behind the back, building the grip and antebraços e pegada.",
  "0105": "A standing Bradford press, lifting the bar from the front of the deltoides e ombros to behind the head and back. Works the delts.",
  "0106": "A standing curl with a narrow grip. Builds the bíceps braquial.",
  "0107": "A front raise where the bar travels past shoulder height up to overhead. Targets the deltoides anteriores.",
  "0108": "A standing calf raise with the barbell on the deltoides e ombros. Builds the panturrilhas.",
  "0109": "A standing overhead tríceps braquial extension with the barbell. Isolates the tríceps braquial.",
  "0110": "A standing curl with an overhand grip. Trains the bíceps braquial, brachialis and antebraços e pegada.",
  "0111": "A standing calf raise in a rocking motion, loading the calf muscles.",
  "0112": "A standing torso twist with the bar on your deltoides e ombros. Works the oblíquos.",
  "0113": "A standing wide-grip curl. Emphasises the inner bíceps braquial.",
