  "0115": "A straight-leg good morning with the bar on the dorsais e trapézio superior. Trains the glúteos, isquiotibiais (posteriores de coxa) and lombar.",
  "0116": "Levantamento terra with nearly straight legs, which targets the isquiotibiais (posteriores de coxa).",
