  "0118": "A bent-over row with an underhand grip. Targets the dorsais e trapézio superior and bíceps braquial.",
  "0119": "An upright row with the barbell pulled toward the chin. Works the delts and trapézio.",
  "0120": "An upright row with the barbell pulled toward the chin. Works the delts and trapézio.",
  "0121": "An upright row with the barbell pulled toward the chin. Works the delts and trapézio.",
  "0122": "Supino with a wide grip. Emphasises the peitoral maior.",
  "0123": "A wide-grip upright row, favouring the side delts and trapézio.",
  "0124": "A back squat with a wide stance. Works the quadríceps, glúteos and adductors.",
  "0125": "A wrist curl with palms up, resting the antebraços e pegada on a bench. Builds the forearm flexors.",
  "0126": "A seated wrist curl with palms up. Builds the forearm flexors.",
  "0127": "Agachamento with the bar held in the crook of the elbows. Works the quadríceps, glúteos and estabilizadores do core.",
  "0128": "Wave the heavy ropes rhythmically to raise heart rate and challenge the deltoides e ombros and arms.",
  "0129": "A bench dip with knees bent. A manageable way to train the tríceps braquial.",
  "0130": "A hip extension from a bench, lifting the hips to work the glúteos.",
  "0131": "A lying twist with bent knees while your dorsais e trapézio superior is on a stability ball. Trabalha principalmente oblíquos and trunk control.",
  "0133": "A side plank with the knees bent, a more approachable version of the full move. Fortalece oblíquos and the side of the hip.",
