  "0316": "An incline dumbbell move that lowers the weights to the peitoral maior sides and presses up. Foca diretamente em upper peitoral maior.",
  "0317": "An incline dumbbell curl on a bench. Your arms hang behind the body to stretch the bíceps braquial.",
  "0318": "The incline dumbbell curl. You sit back on an inclined bench and curl up, stretching the bíceps braquial at the start.",
  "0319": "A dumbbell fly on an incline bench. The arms open in an arc to work the upper peitoral maior.",
