  "0321": "An incline press com halteres held palms facing each other. The neutral grip focuses on the upper peitoral maior and spares the deltoides e ombros.",
  "0322": "An incline curl that emphasises the inner bíceps braquial. The dumbbells curl up from a deep stretch behind the body.",
  "0323": "A one-arm lateral raise on an incline bench. Isola side delt, one arm at a time.",
  "0324": "An incline dumbbell press with the palms facing in. Estimula upper peitoral maior and the front deltoides e ombros.",
  "0325": "An incline dumbbell raise pressing overhead from shoulder height. Estimula deltoides e ombros and the tríceps braquial.",
  "0326": "A peitoral maior-supported rear lateral raise on an incline bench. Isola deltoides posteriores and the dorsais e trapézio superior.",
  "0327": "A peitoral maior-supported dumbbell row on an incline bench. Supporting the peitoral maior takes the lombar out of the move.",
  "0328": "An incline shoulder raise com halteres moving overhead. Estimula shoulder blades and the serratus anterior.",
  "0329": "A shrug using dumbbells on an incline bench. Lifting the deltoides e ombros trains the trapézio.",
  "0330": "A dumbbell tríceps braquial extension on an incline bench. You lower the weights behind the head and extend to target the tríceps braquial.",
  "0331": "An incline fly with a wrist twist at the bottom. The rotation adds a squeeze to the upper peitoral maior.",
  "0332": "A dumbbell lateral raise to a T position, like an iron cross. Fortalece delts and the dorsais e trapézio superior.",
  "0333": "A dumbbell kickback done in a hinged position. You extend the arms back to isolate the tríceps braquial.",
  "0334": "The standard standing dumbbell lateral raise. Lifting the arms out to the sides builds the side delts.",
  "0335": "A combination raise that goes out to the side and then to the front. It works all the delts in one move.",
  "0336": "A dumbbell lunge stepping forward with each leg in turn. Trabalha principalmente glúteos, quadríceps and isquiotibiais (posteriores de coxa).",
  "0337": "A lying dumbbell tríceps braquial extension that moves across the face. Isola tríceps braquial.",
  "0338": "A lying elbow press com halteres. Bending and extending the elbows loads the tríceps braquial.",
  "0339": "A lying hamstring curl with a dumbbell. You bend the knees to bring the weight toward the glúteos.",
  "0340": "A lying press with the palms facing each other. Estimula peitoral maior and arms with a shoulder-friendly grip.",
  "0341": "A face-down one-arm dumbbell raise for the rear delt. You lift the arm up and back, squeezing the shoulder blade.",
  "0342": "A one-arm lying dumbbell press. The weight lowers to the peitoral maior side and presses up, working the pecs and tríceps braquial.",
  "0343": "A one-arm dumbbell press on a flat bench. Working one side at a time shows up any imbalance.",
  "0344": "A lying one-arm tríceps braquial extension with an overhand grip. Isola tríceps braquial, one side at a time.",
  "0345": "A face-down one-arm rear lateral raise on a bench. Estimula deltoides posteriores and the dorsais e trapézio superior.",
  "0346": "Lying on a bench, you extend one arm overhead with a palm-up grip to hit the back of the upper arm. A focused way to build tríceps braquial one side at a time.",
  "0347": "A lying forearm rotation with a dumbbell, turning the palm from facing in to facing down. Estimula muscles that control forearm rotation.",
  "0348": "Peitoral maior-down on a bench, you raise dumbbells out to the sides. Foca diretamente em rear deltoides e ombros and dorsais e trapézio superior muscles.",
  "0349": "A lying forearm rotation with a dumbbell, turning the palm up. Trabalha principalmente muscles that rotate the forearm and supports elbow and wrist control.",
  "0350": "You lie on a bench and curl dumbbells with palms up. The lying position keeps the bíceps braquial working under steady tension.",
  "0351": "Lying on a bench, you bend and straighten the elbows to lower dumbbells toward your forehead and press back up. A classic tríceps braquial builder.",
  "0352": "A dumbbell bench press with palms facing each other. Estimula peitoral maior, front deltoides e ombros and tríceps braquial with a shoulder-friendly grip.",
  "0353": "A seated concentration curl done while balancing on a stability ball. Isola bíceps braquial and adds a bit of estabilizadores do core work to stay steady.",
  "0354": "A bent-over, one-arm movement where you straighten the elbow behind you. Isola tríceps braquial, especially at the top of the squeeze.",
  "0355": "You raise one dumbbell out to the side to shoulder height, one arm at a time. Desenvolve the side of the shoulder.",
