  "0357": "A single-arm dumbbell press with your dorsais e trapézio superior on a stability ball. Staying balanced makes your estabilizadores do core work as hard as the peitoral maior.",
  "0358": "Forearm on a bench or thigh, palm down, you curl the dumbbell up with your wrist. Desenvolve the muscles on top of the forearm.",
  "0359": "Braced on a support, you raise one dumbbell out to the side with a bent torso. Foca diretamente em rear shoulder and dorsais e trapézio superior, one side at a time.",
