  "0363": "You pull one dumbbell up along your body toward chin height with the elbow leading. Trabalha principalmente side deltoides e ombros and upper trapézio.",
  "0364": "Forearm supported and palm up, you curl a dumbbell with only the wrist. Desenvolve the muscles on the underside of the forearm.",
  "0365": "Antebraços e pegada rest over the end of a bench with palms facing in, and you move the dumbbells with your wrists. Desenvolve forearm strength and grip.",
  "0366": "One forearm rests over a bench with the palm facing in, and you move the dumbbell with the wrist. A grip and forearm builder done one side at a time.",
  "0367": "One forearm rests over a bench with the palm up while you curl the dumbbell with your wrist. Desenvolve the underside of the forearm.",
  "0368": "Antebraços e pegada over a bench with palms down, you lift the dumbbells with your wrists. Fortalece top of the antebraços e pegada.",
  "0369": "Antebraços e pegada rest over a bench with palms up, and you curl the dumbbells with your wrists. A direct move for forearm size and grip.",
  "0370": "A hammer curl with the upper arms braced on a preacher pad. The neutral grip hits the bíceps braquial and the muscles beside them.",
  "0371": "A dumbbell squat finished with an explosive jump. Desenvolve leg power and gets the heart rate up.",
  "0372": "You curl a dumbbell with the upper arm braced on a preacher pad. The pad stops swinging so the bíceps braquial do the work.",
