  "0374": "Peitoral maior down on an incline bench, you curl dumbbells from a hanging position. Alonga e fortalece bíceps braquial hard.",
  "0375": "Lying across or along a bench, you lower one dumbbell behind your head and pull it back over your peitoral maior. Estimula peitoral maior and dorsais (grande dorsal) with a deep stretch.",
